  <itemBody><p>Read the sentence from a school-news article and choose the words that make the account accurate.</p><p>After a three-week pilot, the cafeteria team reported that the reusable tray program <inlineChoiceInteraction responseIdentifier="RESPONSE_DECLARATION"><inlineChoice identifier="A">reduced lunchroom waste</inlineChoice><inlineChoice identifier="B">increased disposable packaging</inlineChoice><inlineChoice identifier="C">left trash levels unchanged</inlineChoice><inlineChoice identifier="D">stopped food donations</inlineChoice></inlineChoiceInteraction>, and the strongest evidence was the <inlineChoiceInteraction responseIdentifier="RESPONSE_OUTCOME"><inlineChoice identifier="A">number of students who bought lunch</inlineChoice><inlineChoice identifier="B">drop in bags collected after lunch</inlineChoice><inlineChoice identifier="C">color of the new trays</inlineChoice><inlineChoice identifier="D">menu posted on Monday</inlineChoice></inlineChoiceInteraction>.</p></itemBody>
